 "about": "10CL016 neighbour-LAB links (offline, Quartus builds of design xr:). A source LE in LAB (x, y) feeding one LUT input of a dst LE in LAB (x+dx, y), dx = +/-1. Key 'dx' -> source slot -> dst-side select bits [[frame offset, byte column], ...], same convention as li_local_table.json (relative to the dst LE, mux1cmap.region). Identical at 2 LAB pairs (X10Y10, X22Y8) and 6 dst slots (0, 6, 10, 16, 22, 30) for every source slot. Source-side bits not isolated; not tested on silicon.",
